{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a level crossing game that combines third person shooter and platform jumping, and the game progresses linearly according to the order of the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Description of game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The storyline of the game follows a linear progression through levels in order;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require clever jumping sequences to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require the correct weapon selection to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can unlock more weapons(Unlocked: Weapon 1~Weapon 2);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can encounter more map elements(Opened: Levels 1 to 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development Plan:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The July version plans to open levels 4 to 10 and unlock weapons 3 to 4.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628020?t=1743757231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628020?t=1743757231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/19070585d1d583473deb1a5a7565690c7bfbe19c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743757231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/19070585d1d583473deb1a5a7565690c7bfbe19c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743757231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a level crossing game that combines third person shooter and platform jumping, and the game progresses linearly according to the order of the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Description of game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The storyline of the game follows a linear progression through levels in order;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require clever jumping sequences to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some levels require the correct weapon selection to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can unlock more weapons(Unlocked: Weapon 1~Weapon 2);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the process of passing levels, players can encounter more map elements(Opened: Levels 1 to 3).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development Plan:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The July version plans to open levels 4 to 10 and unlock weapons 3 to 4.</p>","developers":["CHEN JIE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/3762c03ac36ff5847c2452aa5f7c06c9a72871ca/header.jpg?t=1743757231","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119571,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119571/movie480.mp4?t=1743757229","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119571/movie_max.mp4?t=1743757229"},"name":"Third-PersonShooterAndPlatformJumpingAndLevel-basedAdventure","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119571/36d9ee1fd19d88869ba88119f36362c26fc7b069/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743757229","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119571/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743757229","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119571/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743757229"}}],"name":"Third-Person Shooter and Platform Jumping and Level-based Adventure","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron